  "captions": [
    {"start": 0.145, "end": 4.625, "lines": ["This work relies on strong partnerships","across public health, academia,"]},
    {"start": 4.625, "end": 7.025, "lines": ["First Nations, and municipalities."]},
    {"start": 7.025, "end": 9.345, "lines": ["Dr. Smith names several."]},
    {"start": 9.345, "end": 12.545, "lines": ["Again, in partnership","with Vancouver Coastal Health,"]},
    {"start": 12.545, "end": 15.425, "lines": ["Department of Zoology","at UBC, we're partnering"]},
    {"start": 15.425, "end": 20.945, "lines": ["with Squamish Nation once again,","also Tsleil-Waututh Nation, First Nation,"]},
    {"start": 20.945, "end": 25.536, "lines": ["and also municipal and city partners","in North and West Vancouver."]},
    {"start": 25.536, "end": 30.176, "lines": ["Also, it's funded","by the Lionsgate Hospital Foundation,"]},
    {"start": 30.176, "end": 33.616, "lines": ["UBC CDC and the UBC Faculty of Medicine."]},
    {"start": 33.616, "end": 37.456, "lines": ["While researchers work to learn more","about how snowshoe hair virus spreads"]},
    {"start": 37.456, "end": 41.376, "lines": ["among animals and mosquitoes,","there's information that healthcare"]},
    {"start": 41.376, "end": 44.296, "lines": ["and public health professionals can act","on now."]},
    {"start": 44.672, "end": 48.512, "lines": ["So for clinicians, I think what's","really important is within our region,"]},
    {"start": 48.512, "end": 51.872, "lines": ["we've had multiple rounds","with infectious disease and medical"]},
    {"start": 51.872, "end": 53.552, "lines": ["microbiologists to really kind"]},
    {"start": 53.552, "end": 57.312, "lines": ["of consider California stereo group","viruses in patients that are presenting"]},
    {"start": 57.312, "end": 60.912, "lines": ["with unexplained meningitis and","encephalitis during the mosquito season,"]},
    {"start": 60.912, "end": 65.76, "lines": ["particularly if they've had exposures","within these parts of our province."]},
    {"start": 65.76, "end": 70.24, "lines": ["And that really early consultation","with public health and our public health"]},
    {"start": 70.24, "end": 74.64, "lines": ["lab colleagues is really important","so that the appropriate testing"]},
    {"start": 74.64, "end": 79.2, "lines": ["can be organized and expedited","to help establish that diagnosis."]},
    {"start": 79.2, "end": 82.96, "lines": ["And that even though these infections","are uncommon, they still may"]},
    {"start": 82.96, "end": 86.48, "lines": ["be an unrecognized cause of neurological","illness in some communities. And"]},
    {"start": 86.48, "end": 87.44, "lines": ["so it's always important"]},
    {"start": 87.44, "end": 88.48, "lines": ["to kind of consider it as"]},
    {"start": 88.48, "end": 92.08, "lines": ["part of your differential for these","meningitis and encephalitises when other"]},
    {"start": 92.08, "end": 93.36, "lines": ["more common viral"]},
    {"start": 93.36, "end": 97.888, "lines": ["causes have been ruled out. What advice","do you have for families and children"]},
    {"start": 97.888, "end": 101.664, "lines": ["to protect themselves from snowshoe","hair virus and other arboviruses?"]},
    {"start": 101.664, "end": 104.664, "lines": ["Families can reduce their risk by using"]},
    {"start": 105.024, "end": 109.504, "lines": ["insect repellent to prove for children","and following those label directions,"]},
    {"start": 109.504, "end": 112.944, "lines": ["wearing long sleeves and pants","when mosquitoes are most active,"]},
    {"start": 112.944, "end": 115.984, "lines": ["potentially avoiding","or being more cognizant"]},
    {"start": 115.984, "end": 119.744, "lines": ["during dusk and dawn periods","when mosquito activity is greater,"]},
    {"start": 119.744, "end": 124.144, "lines": ["using things like window screens","at night to kind of reduce the amount"]},
    {"start": 124.144, "end": 127.424, "lines": ["of mosquitoes that might be coming in,","and avoiding sort of areas"]},
    {"start": 127.424, "end": 130.88, "lines": ["with heavy mosquito activity and other."]},
    {"start": 130.88, "end": 133.48, "lines": ["Things that people can also do is really"]},
    {"start": 133.84, "end": 138.96, "lines": ["be cognizant of reducing standing water","near your home, clear, drain anything"]},
    {"start": 138.96, "end": 142.24, "lines": ["that can hold stagnant water,","like plant pots, that you know,"]},
    {"start": 142.24, "end": 146.304, "lines": ["the mosquito larvae don't have time to.","Breed in those"]},
